            "review_title": "Review at Seventeen Saloon",
            "review_text": "Cb C\n3 contributions\n0\nMost awesome rock venue!\nSep 2019 • Solo\nThis place is really incredible. 2 live bands playing simultaneously on separate floors, amazing musicians! Really great rock and will play your requests too! Amazing attentive staff - you are never left sitting around waiting for your next beer. Even the ladies who keep the toilets clean are a laugh! \nIncredibly there is no cover charge to get in here. Frankly I don't know how they do it, really well run place! \nI went once to try it and ended up coming back every night!\nAlso - happy hour from 8 to 10, BOGOF if you want to get steamed up😁 (works out at a paltry 2 euro a beer in happy hour - crazy value in a place like this!)\nRead more\nWritten September 24, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
